      "catchup": false,
      "max_active_runs": 1,
      "concurrency": 1
    },
    "tags": [
      "production",
      "financial",
      "cross-sell",
      "customer-analytics",
      "compliance"
    ],
    "default_view": "graph",
    "doc_md": "\n# Deep Cross-Sell Analytics Pipeline\n\n## Purpose\nAnalyze customer propensity for cross-sell products using integrated data from 10 CSV sources.\nGenerate risk-adjusted propensity scores, segment customers into 4 cohorts, and produce\nactionable personalized recommendations with full compliance validation.\n\n## Data Sources (7 Core Files)\n- **application_train.csv** (1.03 MB) - Customer demographics, credit profile, income\n- **previous_application.csv** (386.21 MB) - Historical application records, approval rates\n- **credit_card_balance.csv** (404.91 MB) - Credit card usage, spending patterns, utilization\n- **bureau.csv** (162.14 MB) - Credit bureau accounts, debt, delinquency status\n- **bureau_balance.csv** (358.45 MB) - Payment history, delinquency patterns, payment status\n- **installments_payments.csv** (689.12 MB) - Installment payment compliance, on-time rates\n- **POS_CASH_balance.csv** (374.32 MB) - Point-of-sale transactions, ATM withdrawals\n\n**Total Data Volume**: 2.8 GB integrated dataset\n\n## Processing Phases\n1. **PHASE 1**: Load 7 CSV files with adaptive path discovery\n2. **PHASE 2**: Aggregate by SK_ID_CURR (primary key)\n3. **PHASE 3**: Engineer 10 deep cross-sell features\n4. **PHASE 4**: Segment into 4 customer cohorts, risk-adjust propensity\n5. **PHASE 5**: Validate compliance (Fair Lending, CECL, Data Governance)\n6. **PHASE 6**: Generate outputs (CSV, Excel, Word, HTML, PNG, JSON)\n7. **PHASE 7**: Deploy with orchestration & monitoring\n\n## Compliance Frameworks\n- **Basel III**: Capital adequacy ratios, risk weighting\n- **CECL**: Expected Credit Loss (PD/LGD/EAD calculation)\n- **Fair Lending**: 80% disparate impact rule, demographic parity\n- **KYC/AML**: Transaction monitoring, suspicious activity detection\n- **Data Governance**: 99.5% quality threshold, outlier detection\n\n## Output Deliverables\n- CSV: 5 datasets\n- Excel: 6-sheet workbook\n- Word: SMART recommendations report\n- HTML: Interactive web dashboard\n- PNG: 4-panel visualization\n- JSON: Audit trail files\n- Logs: Full execution logs\n            ",
